PRIVATE REFLECTION: {
- Consensus remains unanimous on the 11 core champions: Gragas, Vi, Jarvan, Fizz, Pyke, Sejuani, Shen, Tryndamere, Urgot, Yone, and Camille, with all other peripheral champions excluded.
- The panel remains divided 8 to 6 exclusively over Riven's Q3.
- The mechanics of the game engine confirm that Riven's Broken Wings enforces complete summoner spell lockout through the landing impact, meaning any buffered Flash resolves strictly after the knockup occurs at the original location rather than relocating it.
- Moving forward, I will maintain the verified 11-champion list and continue to point out that Q3-Flash cannot relocate the knockup packet.
}

